  "youtube": {
    "description": "it's 2001. fog in the valley, nothing but switchbacks and headlights, and you're the only one left out here. 🏁\nY2K drum & bass in the spirit of Rollcage Stage II and the PS1 racing era: breakbeats, rolling bass and that late 90s / early 2000s game soundtrack energy.\n\nPut it on for driving, gaming, coding, studying or just staring out the window pretending you're in a loading screen.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nTRACKLIST\n00:00 Burnout Line\n01:58 Kickdown Run\n04:12 Momentum Stage\n06:26 Night Turbo\n08:40 Gradient\n10:54 Ember Stage\n13:07 Stillwater Transit\n15:22 Highland Run\n17:34 Timberline Stage\n19:50 Final Countersteer\n22:02 Summit Rush\n24:15 Silent Nitro\n26:29 Ridgeline Stage\n28:42 Hollow Loop\n30:56 Night Pass Sprint\n33:10 Night Fogline\n35:24 Hairline\n37:39 Pinewood\n39:52 Kingsroad Stage\n42:06 Switchback Sprint\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🏎️ Visuals: Digital Aura Racing Team\n🎛️ Music: original tracks generated with custom Python scripts\n💿 Inspired by the sound of Rollcage Stage II and classic PS1 racers. Not affiliated with or endorsed by the original game or its publishers.\n\nIf this takes you back, drop your favourite old racing game in the comments and subscribe for more Y2K DnB.\n\n#y2kdnb #drumandbass #ps1",
